  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture For all positive integers $g$ and $k$, there exists an integer $d$ such that every graph of average degree at least $d$ contains a subgraph of average degree at least $k$ and girth greater than $g$.",
